    "question": "A cultivator with 9 tines requires a total draft of $5.4\\text{ kN}$ when pulled at $5.4\\text{ km/h}$ ($1.5\\text{ m/s}$). Calculate the drawbar power required by the cultivator in $\\text{kW}$.",
