    "negative_marks": 0.33,
    "question": "A tractor-mounted boom sprayer has nozzles spaced $50\\text{ cm}$ apart. Each nozzle delivers $1.4\\text{ L/min}$. If the tractor travels at $4.8\\text{ km/h}$, the spray application rate in $\\text{L/ha}$ is:",
